# This folder mixes CLIENT-FACING DELIVERABLES (safe to track) with COMMERCIAL
# AND CONTACT MATERIAL (not safe to track). The rule applied here: anything
# containing pricing, margins, purchase-order references, or a named
# individual's email or phone number stays untracked.
#
# Nothing in this file quotes those values — it only names the files.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Deleted 20 Aug 2026, but kept listed so a recreated copy stays untracked:
