#   po-revision-email.txt — named recipients, PO reference, revised pricing
commercial-quote.md
po-revision-email.txt

# Requirements source of truth: broker contact details, the client's
# internally-reported pain points and tooling constraints (shared in
# confidence), PO status, and the commercials block.
